msgid "START_IMAGE"
msgstr "resources/start_image_en.png"

msgid "START_TEXT"
msgstr ""
"<b>👋 ZAPOMNIM is an advanced Telegram extension</b> operating seamlessly "
"alongside your account, <b>without accessing it directly</b>.\n"
"\n"
"🔒 We enhance your capabilities and safeguard your conversations, ensuring"
" <b>privacy and complete control</b> remain exclusively yours.\n"
"\n"
"🔍 <b>ZAPOMNIM Features</b>:\n"
"- Capturing deleted messages.\n"
"- Message edit history.\n"
"- Saving disappearing media.\n"
"- Scam-checking of unknowns.\n"
"- AI-driven anti-fraud protection.\n"
"- Smart Notifications\n"
"- Customizable bot experience.\n"
"- …and many more features coming soon!\n"
"\n"
"⚡️ <b>Secure. Smart. Convenient. That's ZAPOMNIM.</b>"

msgid "ONLY_FOR_TELEGRAM_PREMIUM"
msgstr ""
"😢 Unfortunately, this bot is available only to Telegram Premium "
"subscribers."

msgid "CONNECT_BUSINESS_BOT_IMAGE"
msgstr "resources/connect_business_bot_image_en.png"

msgid "CONNECT_BUSINESS_BOT_TEXT"
msgstr ""
"<b>Bot Connection Instructions:</b>\n"
"\n"
"1. Go to <b>Settings</b> → <b>Telegram for Business</b>.\n"
"2. Under <b>Chat Bots</b>, insert the link to our bot "
"(<code>@zapomnim_bot</code>).\n"
"3. Grant the bot full message access (required for proper functionality)."

msgid "CONNECT_BUSINESS_BOT_SUCCESS_TEXT"
msgstr ""
"✅ <b>The bot has been successfully connected!</b>\n"
"\n"
"Now, you can setup bot as you need."

msgid "SETUP SECURITY_TEXT"
msgstr ""
"<b>🔐 Security Settings</b>\n"
"\n"
"The bot supports two operating modes: <b>Standard</b> and <b>Enhanced "
"Security</b>. Regardless of the selected mode, <b>your data is "
"protected</b> using advanced encryption and isolation methods.\n"
"\n"
"1. <b>Standard Mode</b> provides access to all bot features.\n"
"\n"
"2. <b>Enhanced Security Mode</b> is designed for those requiring maximum "
"privacy. In this mode, <b>no one can access your data</b>, but the bot's "
"functionality will be limited.\n"
"\n"
"<b>Unavailable features in Enhanced Security Mode</b>:\n"
"- Message edit history\n"
"- AI chat analysis\n"
"- Smart notifications\n"
"- Chat statistics\n"
"- Chat history export\n"
"\n"
"<b>You can switch between modes at any time in the settings.</b>"

msgid "START_BUTTON"
msgstr "🚀 Get Started!"

msgid "CONTINUE_BUTTON"
msgstr "✌️ Continue"

